clGetDeviceInfo(device, CL_DEVICE_MAX_WORK_GROUP_SIZE, sizeof(size_t), &maxWorkGroupSize, NULL);
```

*Note: The skill provides the basic NDRange configuration API but does not include guidance on selecting optimal local work-group sizes based on device properties for image processing tasks.*

