## Dependencies

- OpenCL SDK (NVIDIA, AMD, or Intel)
- OpenCL ICD Loader
- clinfo utility

## Constraints

- OpenCL 2.0+ features not available on all platforms
- Vendor extensions are not portable
- Binary caching requires same device/driver
- SVM requires OpenCL 2.0+ and device support
